# Agreement details regarding prepared or preserved tomatoes.

```catala
declaration scope TomatoAgreementDates:
  input agreement_signed_date content date
  input exchange_letters_date content date
  input renewal_year content date
  output agreement_active content boolean
```

## Agreement Confirmation

The scope confirms the existence and key dates of the agreement regarding prepared or preserved tomatoes.

```catala
scope TomatoAgreementDates:
  date round down
  definition agreement_active equals true
```